{"id":"6c6221762bee7e40","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-subcube.md","title":"Term subcube","display":"df-subcube — Term subcube","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-subcube","aliases":["27-df-subcube"],"display":"df-subcube — Term subcube","depends_on":["[[27-df-term]]","[[27-df-litset]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-subcube"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-subcube</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-subcube — Term subcube"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e065076d6b51508e\" href=\"?note=e065076d6b51508e\" title=\"27-df-term\">27-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8311e93eaac6c631\" href=\"?note=8311e93eaac6c631\" title=\"27-df-litset\">27-df-litset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_L\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\">\\(T_L\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)=L\">\\(\\mathrm{Lits}(T_L)=L\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(T_L)\">\\(T(T_L)\\)</span> (true set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>)</li>\n<li>引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cube}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cube}:\\mathrm{Term}_n\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb B^n)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim:\\{\\mathrm{Cube}(T)\\mid T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(\\dim:\\{\\mathrm{Cube}(T)\\mid T\\in\\mathrm{Term}_n\\}\\to\\{0,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L)\\coloneqq T(T_L)=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\mid T_L(x)=1\\},\\qquad\\dim(\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L))\\coloneqq n-|L|\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L)\\coloneqq T(T_L)=\\{x\\in\\mathbb{B}^{n}\\mid T_L(x)=1\\},\\qquad\\dim(\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L))\\coloneqq n-|L|\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L)|=2^{n-|L|}\">\\(|\\mathrm{Cube}(T_L)|=2^{n-|L|}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"e065076d6b51508e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-litset","status":"resolved","id":"8311e93eaac6c631","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-litset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-true